# API keys for data collectors. Copy to `.env` and fill in what you need.
# Real environment variables take precedence over this file.
# NEVER commit the real .env - it is git-ignored.

# --- OpenRouter (rankings-daily Data API, required for the openrouter source)
# Any valid OpenRouter API key works; create one at https://openrouter.ai/settings/keys
# Data licensed CC BY 4.0. Rate limits: 30 req/min, 500 req/day.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-your-key-here

# --- Vercel AI Gateway (leaderboard export)
# Not required: the public export endpoint needs no authentication.
# Leave unset/empty unless Vercel introduces authenticated exports.
# VERCEL_AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=

# --- Future sources (Phase 2+), documented here so collectors can be added
# without changing the configuration pattern:
# HUGGINGFACE_TOKEN=            # higher rate limits on the HF API (optional)
# EPOCH_API_KEY=                # if Epoch AI requires a key for exports
# ARTIFICIAL_ANALYSIS_API_KEY=  # some Artificial Analysis endpoints are keyed
